 "intro_html": "The soba-shop classic: chicken thigh seared golden and Japanese leek charred in the same pan, then simmered in dashi with soy, sake and mirin. A soba alternative to the rice-noodle stir-fries — same chicken, different bowl from the <a href=\"garlic-ginger-chicken-noodles.html\">garlic-ginger chicken noodles</a>. Make the dashi yourself with the <a href=\"niboshi-bonito-dashi.html\">niboshi–bonito</a> or <a href=\"shiitake-kombu-dashi.html\">shiitake–kombu</a> recipe, or use a dashi packet.",
