   },
   "n": 5,
   "part": null,
   "part_id": null,
   "time": "a few min",
   "time_html": "<span>a few min</span>",
   "title": "Tofu pouch in",
   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Meanwhile, bring a big pot of unsalted water to a boil.</li><li>Fan the soba into the water so the strands stay apart, and stir now and then.</li><li>Cook for the packet time (usually 4–5 minutes) — don’t overcook.</li><li>Drain and rinse under cold running water, rubbing gently, until the water runs clear.</li><li>For a hot bowl, dip the rinsed soba back into the hot water for a few seconds to warm it, then drain well (our addition — see notes).</li></ul>",
   "heat": {
    "label": "high",
    "label_html": "<span>high</span>",
    "off": false
   },
   "id": "step-6",
   "images": {
