    {
     "amount_html": "<span class=\"q\" data-k=\"mass\" data-u=\"g\" data-a=\"200\">200 g</span>",
     "name_html": "Dried soba"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the cold water and potato starch. Stir it again right before pouring it into the soup in a thin stream.</li><li>Stir for 1–2 minutes and take it off the heat when the soup has a <b>light body</b> — don’t let it get thick.</li><li>Skip this for a clear broth, the way soba shops serve it.</li></ul>",
